{% comment %}
  Cart Goal Progress Bar with Tiered Rewards
  ==========================================
  
  A gamified progress bar that incentivizes higher order values by showing
  customers how close they are to unlocking tiered rewards.
  
  Why this approach:
  - Inline CSS ensures styles load immediately without FOUC (Flash of Unstyled Content)
  - Scoped classes prevent conflicts with theme styles
  - Progressive enhancement: works without JS, enhanced with JS
  - Semantic HTML with ARIA attributes for screen readers
  - CSS custom properties allow easy theming while keeping specificity low
  
  @param {number} tier1_threshold - First reward threshold amount
  @param {string} tier1_reward - First reward description
  @param {string} tier1_icon - Emoji/icon for first reward
  ... (see README for full parameter list)
{% endcomment %}

{% comment %} === PARAMETER DEFAULTS === {% endcomment %}
